WEBVTT

00:00:04.320 --> 00:00:07.150
You're quite a stubborn demon.

00:00:07.780 --> 00:00:10.490
I warned you that I cannot
be deceived by illusions.

00:00:12.640 --> 00:00:15.710
You're a mere mortal... How?

00:00:17.070 --> 00:00:20.660
Still, I know all too well 
the solitude you live in,

00:00:22.700 --> 00:00:25.830
Dantalion, Grand Duke of Demons.

00:00:26.690 --> 00:00:29.250
You know nothing, Solomon!

00:00:31.670 --> 00:00:34.160
Foolish, pitiful soul.

00:00:34.830 --> 00:00:36.840
Join me and become mine.

00:00:38.290 --> 00:00:41.470
We're more alike than you realize.

00:00:45.170 --> 00:00:46.200
This will be...

00:00:47.550 --> 00:00:49.940
the signature on our contract.

00:02:31.040 --> 00:02:33.190
Twining was top of the class again, huh?

00:02:33.190 --> 00:02:34.710
He's really something.

00:02:35.070 --> 00:02:37.260
I guess it's no surprise, considering his lineage.

00:02:37.760 --> 00:02:41.430
Folks like us can't compete with that
kind of money and pedigree.

00:02:42.030 --> 00:02:44.640
<i>My name is William Twining.</i>

00:02:45.160 --> 00:02:47.830
<i>As the legitimate son of a line that predates</i>

00:02:47.830 --> 00:02:50.080
<i>even the British Royal Family,</i>

00:02:50.080 --> 00:02:51.950
<i>I am an elite with superior intellect</i>

00:02:51.950 --> 00:02:54.270
<i>and the brightest of futures ahead of me.</i>

00:02:54.270 --> 00:02:55.940
Congrats, William!

00:02:57.140 --> 00:02:58.070
Isaac?

00:02:58.450 --> 00:03:01.250
It's nothing to make a fuss over.

00:03:01.250 --> 00:03:03.430
If I were to balk at such a simple exam,

00:03:03.430 --> 00:03:05.620
it would sully the good name of Twining.

00:03:05.620 --> 00:03:07.370
Cool and composed as ever, I see.

00:03:08.750 --> 00:03:09.720
I suppose.

00:03:11.450 --> 00:03:13.870
First I graduate public school 
at the top of the class,

00:03:13.870 --> 00:03:15.950
with full marks on my A-level exams,

00:03:15.950 --> 00:03:18.160
and then it's straight on to Oxbridge.

00:03:18.160 --> 00:03:20.420
After university, it's either 
political office or law.

00:03:22.000 --> 00:03:26.120
But you were nodding off during 
church! That's got to stop!

00:03:26.120 --> 00:03:27.100
Church?

00:03:28.050 --> 00:03:31.080
What's the point in 
worshiping a nonexistent god?

00:03:31.080 --> 00:03:33.060
I've better things to do with my time.

00:03:33.060 --> 00:03:36.690
What are you saying?! Of course God exists!

00:03:37.120 --> 00:03:39.780
Angels, demons, trolls, 
elves, goblins, dwarves,

00:03:39.780 --> 00:03:43.190
pixies, kolbolds, they're all real!

00:03:43.190 --> 00:03:45.680
That unscientific nonsense again...

00:03:45.680 --> 00:03:49.510
I leave milk and cookies 
by my pillow every night

00:03:49.510 --> 00:03:51.460
so the fairies will grant my wishes—

00:03:51.430 --> 00:03:56.410
Isaac - Third from the bottom

00:03:51.460 --> 00:03:56.630
Unfortunately, it appears your wish for 
higher grades was not granted, Isaac.

00:03:57.540 --> 00:04:01.510
Holiday starts tomorrow. Do some studying.

00:04:04.010 --> 00:04:05.480
Wishes...

00:04:05.970 --> 00:04:07.130
<i>Twining.</i>

00:04:07.980 --> 00:04:12.390
<i>Your tuition for next semester 
hasn't been paid yet.</i>

00:04:12.760 --> 00:04:17.480
<i>That's absurd! My uncle and guardian 
takes proper care of my finances!</i>

00:04:21.560 --> 00:04:23.980
I need to find out what's happened.

00:04:31.970 --> 00:04:34.810
Hello, the master's home!

00:04:35.470 --> 00:04:36.710
Kevin!

00:04:37.240 --> 00:04:38.340
Isn't anyone here?

00:04:38.700 --> 00:04:40.220
Young Master William!

00:04:41.300 --> 00:04:42.910
When did you return?

00:04:42.910 --> 00:04:45.300
Couldn't you come to meet me at the gate?

00:04:45.700 --> 00:04:48.800
Do you realize what a long walk 
it is from the gate to here?

00:04:49.100 --> 00:04:51.720
You should work on your 
stamina, Young Master.

00:04:51.720 --> 00:04:52.600
Quiet, you!

00:04:52.600 --> 00:04:54.210
I don't need stamina.

00:04:54.210 --> 00:04:57.230
I have the kind of brain that should 
be a protected national treasure!

00:04:58.510 --> 00:05:00.570
Wait, those clothes...

00:05:00.860 --> 00:05:03.270
Why are you working out in the fields?

00:05:03.790 --> 00:05:06.370
You're our house steward.

00:05:06.930 --> 00:05:08.030
I'm afraid...

00:05:08.570 --> 00:05:10.990
there's been a bit of a situation.

00:05:11.870 --> 00:05:12.800
What?

00:05:13.700 --> 00:05:16.580
Master Barton, your uncle, 
made some bad investments...

00:05:17.110 --> 00:05:19.090
and went bankrupt.

00:05:20.960 --> 00:05:22.460
Bankrupt?

00:05:22.460 --> 00:05:25.630
Since your mother and father passed away,

00:05:25.630 --> 00:05:28.050
your uncle has been managing 
the family's fortune...

00:05:28.050 --> 00:05:31.390
In other words, nearly everything has 
been taken by debt collectors.

00:05:33.360 --> 00:05:35.810
As you can see, we've been cleaned out.

00:05:37.990 --> 00:05:41.310
Fortunately, we managed to keep the house...

00:05:41.310 --> 00:05:42.440
Wh—

00:05:43.030 --> 00:05:45.900
What of my grand and glorious future?!

00:05:43.130 --> 00:05:45.020
Straight down the path to society's elite!

00:05:46.710 --> 00:05:48.860
And what of my uncle?

00:05:49.170 --> 00:05:50.770
He's disappeared.

00:05:51.550 --> 00:05:54.970
Knowing him, I'm sure he's in no danger...

00:05:54.970 --> 00:05:56.410
Indeed...

00:05:57.550 --> 00:05:59.250
What about the other servants?!

00:05:59.840 --> 00:06:02.660
Everyone except me has left.

00:06:03.400 --> 00:06:04.250
Right...

00:06:04.740 --> 00:06:08.250
It's not like I can pay their salaries.

00:06:11.370 --> 00:06:12.850
I guess you're free, too.

00:06:13.940 --> 00:06:16.350
I have no intention of leaving.

00:06:18.410 --> 00:06:24.440
The Cecil family has served 
the Twinings for generations.

00:06:24.760 --> 00:06:27.290
I shall remain ever at your side.

00:06:29.050 --> 00:06:30.180
Kevin...

00:06:31.680 --> 00:06:32.950
Thanks.

00:06:32.950 --> 00:06:33.960
Not at all.

00:06:33.960 --> 00:06:34.950
Besides...

00:06:35.420 --> 00:06:38.620
I'm staking everything on 
that big brain of yours!

00:06:38.620 --> 00:06:42.260
Please grow up to make a fortune off bribes!

00:06:42.260 --> 00:06:44.420
What am I, your lotto ticket?

00:06:44.420 --> 00:06:48.380
That's right, my tuition! If I can't 
pay, I'll have to quit school!

00:06:50.460 --> 00:06:54.300
Damn, isn't there anything left that's worth money?

00:06:56.010 --> 00:06:56.770
Kevin.

00:06:57.430 --> 00:07:01.660
Do you know if there's anything like 
a hidden safe or secret room?

00:07:01.660 --> 00:07:03.160
Maybe a hidden door?

00:07:03.530 --> 00:07:06.780
Come now, this isn't a fairy tale. Such things...

00:07:11.470 --> 00:07:12.460
...do exist.

00:07:12.980 --> 00:07:15.420
I had no idea there was a door 
like this in the basement.

00:07:16.810 --> 00:07:19.160
The Twining family's hidden treasure?

00:07:19.160 --> 00:07:20.590
Or maybe...

00:07:24.080 --> 00:07:25.660
What are you going to do?

00:07:25.660 --> 00:07:28.120
If it won't open, I'll break it down.

00:07:28.640 --> 00:07:29.300
Here goes!

00:07:33.580 --> 00:07:34.260
Young Master!

00:07:34.260 --> 00:07:35.440
Ow...

00:07:35.440 --> 00:07:37.260
That was reckless!

00:07:38.280 --> 00:07:39.860
Look, you're bleeding!

00:07:40.560 --> 00:07:42.750
It's just a little scrape.

00:07:51.780 --> 00:07:56.320
We finally meet, bearer of Solomon's soul.

00:07:56.610 --> 00:07:58.450
Wh-Who are you?!

00:07:59.380 --> 00:08:02.090
Surely you haven't forgotten me?

00:08:03.050 --> 00:08:08.450
I am Dantalion, Grand Duke 
of the 36 Armies of Hell,

00:08:08.450 --> 00:08:12.170
and the most suitable candidate 
to rule over all Hell!

00:08:12.850 --> 00:08:14.550
Now, elect me!

00:08:16.960 --> 00:08:21.410
So my ancestor was King Solomon, 
who subjugated 72 demons called pillars,

00:08:21.410 --> 00:08:24.690
and sealed them in some vessel, you say?

00:08:25.400 --> 00:08:26.780
Correct.

00:08:28.380 --> 00:08:31.570
Sorry. I haven't read much of the Bible.

00:08:31.570 --> 00:08:32.970
Is that from the New Testament?

00:08:32.970 --> 00:08:35.860
King Solomon was in the Old Testament.

00:08:36.050 --> 00:08:38.400
Damn it! If you weren't the Elector,

00:08:38.400 --> 00:08:40.830
I'd steal your soul this instant!

00:08:41.020 --> 00:08:43.160
Seized

00:08:41.190 --> 00:08:43.160
Silence, unlawful intruder.

00:08:43.160 --> 00:08:45.350
Just listen to me!

00:08:45.350 --> 00:08:48.290
We demons live in a hierarchical 
society just like humans!

00:08:48.930 --> 00:08:51.110
The emperor, Lucifer, rules over Hell.

00:08:51.110 --> 00:08:53.540
He is served by the seven demon kings,

00:08:53.540 --> 00:08:55.550
who are served by twenty-four 
demon dukes, and so forth.

00:08:56.070 --> 00:09:00.280
The only one who can choose a new king 
to rule in His Highness Lucifer's place

00:09:00.280 --> 00:09:03.070
is the Elector granted authority by His Highness!

00:09:03.900 --> 00:09:05.050
I see.

00:09:06.010 --> 00:09:08.270
Is that all you wish to say?

00:09:09.240 --> 00:09:10.840
What's the meaning of this?

00:09:10.840 --> 00:09:13.460
How dare you treat a demon duke—

00:09:13.460 --> 00:09:14.780
Ridiculous.

00:09:15.250 --> 00:09:16.930
Did you really expect me

00:09:16.930 --> 00:09:19.630
to believe all that blather about 
Hell and Solomon and whatnot?

00:09:19.630 --> 00:09:20.940
Vile con artist.

00:09:20.940 --> 00:09:21.990
What'd you call me?!

00:09:21.990 --> 00:09:23.540
I'm so sorry.

00:09:23.540 --> 00:09:27.370
The Young Master is a hard-line realist 
with a love for modern science.

00:09:27.630 --> 00:09:31.340
There is nothing in this world that 
can't be explained with a formula.

00:09:32.170 --> 00:09:35.530
Honestly, I thought I'd find something 
I could make money off of,

00:09:35.530 --> 00:09:37.130
and all I get is this useless bum.

00:09:36.860 --> 00:09:37.930
Useless Bum!

00:09:38.390 --> 00:09:39.540
You impertinent...

00:09:39.540 --> 00:09:40.880
You capture the great Dantalion,

00:09:40.880 --> 00:09:42.980
and then have the gall to call me useless?!

00:09:42.980 --> 00:09:44.680
That's right.

00:09:44.680 --> 00:09:47.510
The only thing I need right now 
is tuition for next semester,

00:09:47.510 --> 00:09:48.520
and that's it.

00:09:49.290 --> 00:09:50.520
Listen to what I'm—

00:10:00.280 --> 00:10:03.350
What kind of trick did he use?

00:10:06.290 --> 00:10:09.250
There must be a secret room 
under the floor somewhere.

00:10:09.250 --> 00:10:12.050
It'd be too expensive to dig it up, though.

00:10:13.700 --> 00:10:18.790
Kevin, didn't my father have a
ring he was really protective of?

00:10:19.700 --> 00:10:21.490
Young Master, that ring...

00:10:21.490 --> 00:10:24.410
Don't tell me they took that, too?!

00:10:24.410 --> 00:10:25.390
No...

00:10:26.970 --> 00:10:27.940
Kevin?

00:10:29.660 --> 00:10:31.020
Young Master, behind you!

00:10:33.790 --> 00:10:34.650
Young Master!

00:10:44.430 --> 00:10:45.340
Young Master...

00:10:58.190 --> 00:11:00.220
Where am I?

00:11:02.940 --> 00:11:05.890
My, my. What a rare visitor we have here.

00:11:06.840 --> 00:11:07.980
A goat?!

00:11:08.620 --> 00:11:10.850
Oh, a costume party, right?

00:11:11.490 --> 00:11:14.820
But why is there a costume 
party under my basement?

00:11:17.970 --> 00:11:18.820
I'm dreaming!

00:11:19.120 --> 00:11:21.860
You have a talent for coming 
to the easiest conclusion.

00:11:23.410 --> 00:11:25.450
Sir William Twining.

00:11:25.940 --> 00:11:28.400
Have you come to call on my master?

00:11:28.400 --> 00:11:29.440
Master?

00:11:29.440 --> 00:11:30.500
Yes, sir.

00:11:30.500 --> 00:11:34.180
The Phenomenal Grand Duke of 
Hell, His Excellency Dantalion.

00:11:34.180 --> 00:11:35.020
You mean...

00:11:35.020 --> 00:11:37.460
That costumed buffoon?!

00:11:37.460 --> 00:11:40.850
Master, why are you 
sneaking around outside?

00:11:40.850 --> 00:11:44.010
We should just break in 
and wrap this up quickly!

00:11:44.010 --> 00:11:46.770
Silence, Amon, Mammon, 
before I spit roast you both!

00:11:48.050 --> 00:11:51.740
The Elector is bad enough, 
but his butler is—

00:11:51.740 --> 00:11:52.600
Oh?

00:11:52.880 --> 00:11:56.310
Where have you taken my 
Young Master, you sneak thief?!

00:11:52.920 --> 00:11:57.610
Super Art Instant Rope Binding Jutsu

00:11:56.310 --> 00:11:57.610
That's what I want to know!

00:11:57.970 --> 00:12:01.580
I searched the entire basement 
and didn't find so much as a hair!

00:12:02.050 --> 00:12:02.820
He couldn't be...

00:12:06.780 --> 00:12:08.550
Stop! Where are you—

00:12:14.380 --> 00:12:16.130
It's better than my chef's!

00:12:16.130 --> 00:12:19.460
I am honored and humbled by your approval.

00:12:20.520 --> 00:12:26.430
But why is my basement connected 
to that costumed fool's house?

00:12:26.990 --> 00:12:29.260
Is there some kind of secret passage?

00:12:29.260 --> 00:12:31.770
No, not exactly.

00:12:32.930 --> 00:12:34.350
Oh, also,

00:12:34.350 --> 00:12:37.220
if you're that man's butler,

00:12:37.220 --> 00:12:39.850
tell him not to set foot in my house again.

00:12:39.850 --> 00:12:42.450
He did nothing but ramble about nonsense.

00:12:42.450 --> 00:12:43.850
It was infuriating.

00:12:44.680 --> 00:12:48.620
It sounds as though you didn't believe him...

00:12:49.220 --> 00:12:52.260
There are numerous factions within Hell,

00:12:52.870 --> 00:12:56.010
each with its own candidate 
to become interim ruler.

00:12:58.110 --> 00:13:00.420
So it's a turf war.

00:13:00.660 --> 00:13:02.530
That's a bit blunt, but yes.

00:13:02.990 --> 00:13:05.620
But if they're talking about replacements,

00:13:05.620 --> 00:13:08.280
what is the current ruler doing?

00:13:08.280 --> 00:13:09.600
Does he have nothing to say?

00:13:09.990 --> 00:13:13.550
The current emperor of Hell, 
His Highness Lucifer,

00:13:13.550 --> 00:13:16.180
is currently in a deep slumber.

00:13:16.180 --> 00:13:19.940
The higher a demon's rank in Hell, 
they longer they must sleep.

00:13:21.880 --> 00:13:24.440
And you need an interim ruler until he wakes up.

00:13:24.440 --> 00:13:26.160
You don't believe me.

00:13:26.160 --> 00:13:29.030
I'm a realist who loves science.

00:13:30.110 --> 00:13:31.300
Demons, you say?

00:13:31.300 --> 00:13:32.440
Silliness.

00:13:32.930 --> 00:13:35.710
Who in this day and age 
still believes in demons—

00:13:41.480 --> 00:13:43.090
Umm..

00:13:43.520 --> 00:13:45.370
What just happened?

00:13:46.030 --> 00:13:47.470
Hi!

00:13:48.420 --> 00:13:51.570
Pardon the intrusion.

00:13:51.570 --> 00:13:52.640
Gilles de Rais.

00:13:53.110 --> 00:13:57.100
My apologies, but the 
master is currently out.

00:13:57.100 --> 00:13:58.950
Is he now?

00:13:57.760 --> 00:13:58.950
Gilles de Rais?

00:13:58.950 --> 00:14:01.230
What a shame.

00:14:01.230 --> 00:14:03.710
I thought today would be the day I'd get to

00:14:03.710 --> 00:14:06.320
destroy His Excellency's soul 
and raise my standing.

00:14:07.650 --> 00:14:09.030
Hmm?

00:14:09.240 --> 00:14:12.050
A human, you're a human, yes?

00:14:12.050 --> 00:14:13.740
How nostalgic.

00:14:14.160 --> 00:14:16.300
What brings you here?

00:14:16.300 --> 00:14:21.340
Was the leader of us Nephilim, 
Dantalion, getting homesick?

00:14:21.340 --> 00:14:23.300
N-Nephilim?

00:14:23.840 --> 00:14:26.640
What are you, a new kind of terrorist?

00:14:28.850 --> 00:14:31.140
Well, if he's not here, he's not here.

00:14:31.140 --> 00:14:34.520
I'll just take this boy instead.

00:14:37.780 --> 00:14:39.520
Did he put you up to this?!

00:14:40.870 --> 00:14:44.440
It's only been 400 years since I died.

00:14:44.440 --> 00:14:46.980
We newcomers need to do whatever
we can to increase our status.

00:14:48.500 --> 00:14:50.030
Don't bother.

00:14:53.060 --> 00:14:55.690
If you want the boy back unharmed,

00:14:55.690 --> 00:14:59.350
tell Dantalion to meet me at Cocytus.

00:14:59.350 --> 00:15:02.170
<i>Impossible, this can't be real!</i>

00:15:03.200 --> 00:15:03.670
<i>Someone...</i>

00:15:05.200 --> 00:15:06.230
Kevi—

00:15:07.710 --> 00:15:08.920
Take your hands...

00:15:11.510 --> 00:15:12.720
...off him!

00:15:19.150 --> 00:15:21.650
He belongs to me!

00:15:24.390 --> 00:15:25.280
You hurt?

00:15:25.710 --> 00:15:26.860
N-No...

00:15:28.390 --> 00:15:30.560
Hey, I didn't call for you!

00:15:30.560 --> 00:15:31.740
Excuse me?!

00:15:32.330 --> 00:15:34.450
I just saved your life, you ingrate!

00:15:34.450 --> 00:15:35.870
Who asked you to?

00:15:35.870 --> 00:15:36.820
Master.

00:15:38.100 --> 00:15:39.710
Don't worry.

00:15:49.000 --> 00:15:52.860
What happened? Was that 
a dream within a dream?

00:15:52.860 --> 00:15:54.260
You still don't believe us?

00:15:54.530 --> 00:15:55.600
Of course not!

00:15:55.870 --> 00:15:57.680
This is the modern age, demon's don't—

00:16:00.310 --> 00:16:01.310
We do.

00:16:02.910 --> 00:16:05.440
It's been too long, Dantalion.

00:16:05.740 --> 00:16:09.030
Leave now and I'll forget this happened.

00:16:09.030 --> 00:16:11.900
I'm afraid I can't do that now.

00:16:12.380 --> 00:16:13.580
What?

00:16:13.580 --> 00:16:15.270
That human...

00:16:15.270 --> 00:16:19.650
I couldn't fathom why you'd 
invite a human to your abode.

00:16:19.650 --> 00:16:20.790
Then it hit me.

00:16:21.270 --> 00:16:23.500
He's the Elector.

00:16:25.050 --> 00:16:28.090
A descendant of Solomon himself.

00:16:28.630 --> 00:16:29.340
Silence!

00:16:29.570 --> 00:16:33.220
Once I figured that out, I simply 
had to have him for myself!

00:16:33.440 --> 00:16:37.180
Duke Baalberith will be thrilled 
if I bring him back.

00:16:37.420 --> 00:16:41.180
He wants the replacement to be 
one of his followers, after all.

00:16:41.880 --> 00:16:43.480
You blue-faced clown.

00:16:43.840 --> 00:16:46.480
Fine, I'll roast you again, 
if that's what you want.

00:16:47.070 --> 00:16:49.670
Just like your beloved virgin!

00:16:50.100 --> 00:16:56.070
Don't you dare speak of her 
with that filthy mouth!

00:17:02.220 --> 00:17:03.750
Get back, William!

00:17:06.330 --> 00:17:09.750
I will crush you to dust, Dantalion!

00:17:12.770 --> 00:17:15.590
<i>Is this real life?</i>

00:17:15.590 --> 00:17:17.450
Sir William, this way!

00:17:22.690 --> 00:17:24.030
That man...

00:17:24.790 --> 00:17:27.830
He serves Grand Duke Baalberith,

00:17:27.830 --> 00:17:31.860
another faction leader who is
vying for the emperor's throne.

00:17:33.040 --> 00:17:35.570
Basically, they are political rivals.

00:17:35.950 --> 00:17:38.990
That's a pretty intense rivalry.

00:17:40.210 --> 00:17:43.410
The fastest way to raise one's 
status is to announce candidacy

00:17:43.410 --> 00:17:45.290
by killing a demon of greater power.

00:17:47.960 --> 00:17:50.420
That is how Hell operates.

00:17:50.910 --> 00:17:53.080
Done already?

00:17:53.080 --> 00:17:56.530
I don't want to believe that.

00:18:01.870 --> 00:18:03.510
Rest easy, then!

00:18:11.160 --> 00:18:13.530
I'll take extra special care of you now.

00:18:15.300 --> 00:18:19.310
I think that cleared my head a little.

00:18:19.310 --> 00:18:21.080
You really are strong.

00:18:21.940 --> 00:18:26.380
I can see why His Highness 
Lucifer favors you.

00:18:27.080 --> 00:18:34.710
But how many human souls did you send to him to gain such power,

00:18:34.710 --> 00:18:36.860
Your Excellency Dantalion?

00:18:38.060 --> 00:18:40.390
We're the same, after all, aren't we?

00:18:40.390 --> 00:18:45.410
We're both Nephilim, demons 
who were once human.

00:18:45.410 --> 00:18:48.560
Humans who were mass murderers.

00:18:48.860 --> 00:18:49.810
Silence.

00:18:50.060 --> 00:18:53.770
Enough victims to color the ocean red.

00:18:53.770 --> 00:18:55.390
Shut up!

00:18:58.630 --> 00:19:02.810
This is bad. If the master 
uses his true power now,

00:19:02.810 --> 00:19:04.400
the dimensional space will distort.

00:19:05.540 --> 00:19:06.500
What?

00:19:06.500 --> 00:19:10.080
That would mean you'd be stuck here.

00:19:10.900 --> 00:19:12.650
Quit joking around, you stupid goat!

00:19:12.650 --> 00:19:13.900
Goat, you say?

00:19:13.900 --> 00:19:15.380
I'm a butler.

00:19:15.380 --> 00:19:19.090
I don't care, just fix it! 
He's your master!

00:19:19.090 --> 00:19:23.350
I'm afraid I've no way to stop
them with my meager abilities...

00:19:39.400 --> 00:19:43.200
Damn it, I'm not going to be stuck 
in this incomprehensible place!

00:19:43.670 --> 00:19:45.160
I want to go home!

00:20:04.630 --> 00:20:05.350
No!

00:20:05.770 --> 00:20:06.930
Die!

00:20:07.560 --> 00:20:09.190
Stop, Dantalion!

00:20:13.060 --> 00:20:14.100
My powers...

00:20:15.010 --> 00:20:18.030
Sir William, what did you do?

00:20:18.030 --> 00:20:19.120
No idea!

00:20:19.940 --> 00:20:23.530
Hey! If you have to go on a 
rampage, send me home first!

00:20:23.860 --> 00:20:25.970
I need to find a way to pay my tuition.

00:20:25.970 --> 00:20:28.920
I've got no time to watch you two fight!

00:20:29.980 --> 00:20:35.040
Interesting. I see the Elector 
is more than a normal human.

00:20:35.040 --> 00:20:38.710
I must inform Sir Baalberith.

00:20:39.020 --> 00:20:42.880
I'll take my leave for today, 
but we'll meet again soon.

00:20:43.960 --> 00:20:44.960
He vanished...

00:20:47.330 --> 00:20:48.610
Solomon!

00:20:48.610 --> 00:20:51.180
Huh? My name is William Twining.

00:20:51.180 --> 00:20:52.640
No! You are...

00:20:57.350 --> 00:20:58.860
<i>This is the pits.</i>

00:20:58.860 --> 00:21:00.940
<i>Demons, Electors...</i>

00:21:00.940 --> 00:21:04.200
<i>I got dragged around by 
those incomprehensible freaks,</i>

00:21:04.200 --> 00:21:06.320
<i>and had no time to raise 
money to pay my tuition.</i>

00:21:06.740 --> 00:21:09.400
Hey, William! How was your break?

00:21:09.400 --> 00:21:11.540
It was the worst experience of my life.

00:21:11.540 --> 00:21:12.940
That's awful!

00:21:12.940 --> 00:21:14.730
You must be haunted by a malevolent spirit!

00:21:14.730 --> 00:21:16.830
Should I use white magic? A talisman? 
Which would you prefer?

00:21:17.920 --> 00:21:19.780
I've been summoned by the principal.

00:21:19.780 --> 00:21:22.700
I don't have time for 
your occult nonsense.

00:21:25.140 --> 00:21:26.790
It's been paid?!

00:21:26.790 --> 00:21:30.490
I should've expected as much from 
England's most prestigious family!

00:21:30.490 --> 00:21:34.060
Your lineage is matched 
only by your net worth!

00:21:34.060 --> 00:21:37.880
Not since the school was founded have 
we received such a generous donation!

00:21:41.690 --> 00:21:44.820
<i>Who could it have been? My uncle?</i>

00:21:45.040 --> 00:21:48.240
<i>No, I haven't even been 
able to contact him...</i>

00:21:48.240 --> 00:21:49.960
Quiet down, everyone.

00:21:50.820 --> 00:21:53.250
I'd like to introduce our new transfer student.

00:21:53.960 --> 00:21:55.120
A transfer student?

00:21:55.120 --> 00:21:56.870
That's odd at this point in the year.

00:21:57.290 --> 00:21:59.990
Come in, Huber.

00:22:02.650 --> 00:22:05.590
Hello, my name is Dantalion Huber.

00:22:05.590 --> 00:22:06.970
Pleased to meet you all.

00:23:41.170 --> 00:23:43.060
My name is William Twining.

00:23:43.060 --> 00:23:45.640
I'm brilliant, handsome, 
and well-mannered.

00:23:45.640 --> 00:23:49.050
Perfect in every way. So perfect, 
in fact, that it scares me!

00:23:49.860 --> 00:23:51.150
You have scary dreams?

00:23:51.150 --> 00:23:54.690
I'll lie beside you, but 
wouldn't that be scarier?
